WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,540 --> 00:00:04,940
Master Song! Turn around!

2
00:00:08,460 --> 00:00:09,860
Xiaomei, stop

3
00:00:12,130 --> 00:00:13,330
They are stronghold members

4
00:00:13,330 --> 00:00:17,330
The member you want to protect is me. His name is Xiaomei.

5
00:00:17,730 --> 00:00:19,130
Responsible for guarding the courtyard from now on

6
00:00:19,130 --> 00:00:20,330
You are the new ones

7
00:00:20,530 --> 00:00:22,130
Use the ability you just had on me once

8
00:00:22,330 --> 00:00:31,780
No response either

9
00:00:32,380 --> 00:00:34,380
Green level rule control doesn't work for me

10
00:00:35,010 --> 00:00:36,810
But it cannot be judged as a higher level

11
00:00:36,810 --> 00:00:38,610
Just because you're not capable doesn't mean you're worthless

12
00:00:39,010 --> 00:00:40,810
You can stay as long as you follow the rules
